               <msContents>
                  <summary>Prayer to Mary, “Guard me,” ዕቀብኒ; Image of the Icon, መልክአ፡ ሥዕል፡</summary>
                  <textLang mainLang="gez">Gǝ‘ǝz</textLang>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">
                     <locus from="1r" to="13r" facs="003"/>
                     <title>Prayer to Mary, “Guard me,” <foreign xml:lang="gez">ዕቀብኒ።</foreign>
                     </title>
                     <incipit xml:lang="gez">በስመ፡ አብ፡ ወወልድ፡ <gap reason="omitted"/> ኦ፡ እግዝእትየ፡ ማርያም፡ እስመ፡ ክብርት፡ አንቲ፡ እምኵሉ፡ ፍጡር፡ በሰማይ፡ ወበምድር፡ አልቦ፡ ዘይከብር፡ እምኔኪ፡ <gap reason="omitted"/>
                     </incipit>
                  </msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i2">
                     <locus from="13v" to="20v" facs="016"/>
                     <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3088RepCh368">ʾO-rǝḫrǝḫta ḫǝllinā</title>
                     <incipit xml:lang="gez">ሕሊና፡ (ዘ)አፍቅሮተ፡ ሰብእ፡ ልማዳ፡ ሰአሊተ፡ ምሕረት፡ ይእቲ፡ ማርያም፡ ሐፁረ፡ መስቀል፡ ዘየዓውዳ፡</incipit>
                  </msItem>
                  </msContents>
